This is an application for creating astrophoto.

To get better result unlike standard camera. 

This app set max exposure time for your iPhone and blend images. You can manage ISO value and focus camera destination.

App includes 5 modes for photo:
• Sunrise/Sunset;
• Stars;
• Sky;
• Northern Lights;
• Lightning.
   - Mode for catch lightning (Every lightning will be on photo). 

After set timer exposure time and get result photo.
